# Large constant list literals: a thousand primitive elements, every primitive
# width at its extreme bit pattern, a thousand text and byte elements, and long
# text elements read by index after the parent list detaches. These are the
# executed programs of the retired QBE list literal payload tests
# (`qbe_list_literal_test.zig`, `LIST-LITERAL-PAYLOAD-1`), which also read the
# emitted IL, the payload bytes and the static image metadata. Here each program
# keeps what its caller can observe: the length and the first and last element.
